+    TURBOchannel with the lines of the DZ serial line multiplexer of the
+    system slot, the network controller of slot 6 and the color frame buffer
+    of slot 0 if the slot has one, and the SCSI adapter of slot 5.
=1 52 3
+    Monitor - Not used, the firmware has no video driver.
+
+    Floppy, Floppy2 - Not used, the DECstation 5000/200 has no floppy
+        controller.
